    </div><div data-slot="kind">
        <div class="kind"><div>
            <span class="k">ઉદાહરણ</span><span class="fb-group"><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3976641"><span class="fb" lang="en">administrative territorial entity of Kenya</span></a><a class="add-label"
