    <div class="body"><p>Nairobi is <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q184711">twinned</a> with:</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q115">Ethiopia</a> <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3624">Addis Ababa</a>, Ethiopia</li>
<li><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q258">South Africa</a> <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q5465">Cape Town</a>, South Africa</li>
<li><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q30">United States</a> <ruby><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q16554">Denver</a><rt><span>ડેનવર</span></rt></ruby>, United States</li>
<li><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q148">China</a> <ruby><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q182852">Kunming</a><rt><span>કુન્મિંગ</span></rt></ruby>, China</li>
<li><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q30">United States</a> <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q49162">Lowell</a>, United States</li>
<li><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q30">United States</a> <ruby><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q41087">Raleigh</a><rt><span>રેલે</span></rt></ruby>, United States</li>
<li><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q155">Brazil</a> <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q28441">São Luís</a>, Brazil</li></ul><a class="read" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nairobi#Twin_towns_and_sister_cities">Twin towns and sister cities ↗</a>
